,"BOARD_TYPE":"行业","BOARD_LEVEL":"1"},{"SECUCODE":"603533.SH","SECURITY_CODE":"603533","SECURITY_NAME_ABBR":"掌阅科技","BOARD_CODE":"1673","BOARD_NAME":"破增发价股","SELECTED_BOARD_REASON":null,"IS_PRECISE":null,"BOARD_RANK":5,"BOARD_YIELD":null,"NEW_BOARD_CODE":"BK1673","DERIVE_BOARD_CODE":"BI1673","BOARD_TYPE":null,"BOARD_LEVEL":null},{"SECUCODE":"603533.SH","SECURITY_CODE":"603533","SECURITY_NAME_ABBR":"掌阅科技","BOARD_CODE":"1654","BOARD_NAME":"文娱消费","SELECTED_BOARD_REASON":"2025年8月12日公告显示，目前，公司短剧业务已经成为公司第一大业务，公司已经从“互联网时代的数字阅读平台”战略升级为“人工智能时代的多模态内容生产运营平台”。短剧业务目前呈现形态主要是小程序短剧，自有平台速看短剧等APP正在推广。","IS_PRECISE":"1","BOARD_RANK":13,"BOARD_YIELD":null,"NEW_BOARD_CODE":"BK1654","DERIVE_BOARD_CODE":"BI1654","BOARD_TYPE":null,"BOARD_LEVEL":null},{"SECUCODE":"603533.SH","SECURITY_CODE":"603533","SECURITY_NAME_ABBR":"掌阅科技","BOARD_CODE":"1633","BOARD_NAME":"昨日高振幅","SELECTED_BOARD_REASON":null,"IS_PRECISE":"0","BOARD_RANK":6,"BOARD_YIELD":null,"NEW_BOARD_CODE":"BK1633","DERIVE_BOARD_CODE":"BI1633","BOARD_TYPE":null,"BOARD_LEVEL":null},{"SECUCODE":"603533.SH","SECURITY_CODE":"603533","SECURITY_NAME_ABBR":"掌阅科技","BOARD_CODE":"1629","BOARD_NAME":"AI应用","SELECTED_BOARD_REASON":"2025年半年报显示，报告期内，公司积极推进AI大模型在数字阅读和短剧中的应用，充分利用在内容版权资源、创作者生态、海量用户资源等领域的优势，将国内领先AI大模型和公司内外部业务场景深度融合。在数字阅读领域，在掌阅APP现有书童导读、速览群书、书籍摘要、一键速读、逐句精读、思维导图等AI辅助阅读功能基础上，继续推出“AI讲书电台”，通过双人虚拟角色对话的创新形式，构建更具沉浸感和多元表达力的智能听书体验，为用户在不同阅读阶段提供陪伴式、交互式的内容服务。","IS_PRECISE":"1","BOARD_RANK":14,"BOARD_YIELD":null,"NEW_BOARD_CODE":"BK1629","DERIVE_BOARD_CODE":"BI1629","BOARD_TYPE":null,"BOARD_LEVEL":null},{"SECUCODE":"603533.SH","SECURITY_CODE":"603533","SECURITY_NAME_ABBR":"掌阅科技","BOARD_CODE":"150","BOARD_NAME":"北京板块","SELECTED_BOARD_REASON":null,"IS_PRECISE":"0","BOARD_RANK":4,"BOARD_YIELD":null,"NEW_BOARD_CODE":"BK0150","DERIVE_BOARD_CODE":"BI0150","BOARD_TYPE":"板块","BOARD_LEVEL":null},{"SECUCODE":"603533.SH","SECURITY_CODE":"603533","SECURITY_NAME_ABBR":"掌阅科技","BOARD_CODE":"1298","BOARD_NAME":"文字媒体","SELECTED_BOARD_REASON":null,"IS_PRECISE":null,"B